their own projects as defense in depth; embeddings and qloo_cache stay backend-only.&#10;population_studies and social_simulations share their id with their run. Line ends: many at the child, one at the parent." style="text;html=0;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=12;fontColor=#374151;fontStyle=0;spacing=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="28.0" y="957.25" width="1378" height="45.0" as="geometry"/></mxCell></root></mxGraphModel></diagram></mxfile>
